#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
TRACEATLAS / HEALTHINT — Local privacy-first public-health intelligence pipeline.

IMPORTANT SAFETY / POLICY NOTES:
- This is a local demo implementation.
- It does NOT access live health ministries, hospitals, laboratories, wastewater systems,
  pharmacies, registries, social platforms, private medical records, or clinical systems.
- It does NOT diagnose individuals, prescribe medication, alter treatment, ration care,
  determine insurance/employment eligibility, or profile private persons.
- It does NOT reidentify de-identified data, expose small-cell sensitive health information,
  infer health status from face/voice/posts/purchases/location, or conduct covert surveillance.
- It does NOT design, enhance, optimize, weaponize, disseminate, or evade detection for pathogens.
- It supports authorized, population-level, privacy-preserving, evidence-first public-health
  intelligence only.
- Sample data is synthetic and aggregated.
"""

